# Manager Monorepo — AI Context

This workspace contains **BE/** (Spring Boot) and **FE/** (React).

Before coding:
1. Read `AGENTS.md` — choose BE or FE based on task
2. Read `docs/PROJECT-STATUS.md` — overall progress
3. Read sub-project rules:
   - BE → `BE/docs/PROJECT-RULES.md`
   - FE → `FE/docs/PROJECT-RULES.md`

Slash commands (root `.cursor/commands/`):
- `/start` — begin session
- `/new-feature-be` / `/new-feature-fe` — new feature
- `/write-tests-be` / `/write-tests-fe` — write tests
- `/review-pr` — code review
- `/update-status` — update status docs

When task spans both stacks, keep BE API_SPEC and FE DATA_MODEL in sync.
